nmos-dcm (2.2.9+mxl1-7) unstable; urgency=low

  * nmosDriver.py: bootstrap fixed-id, pre-staged, pre-activated mxl
    senders from a static JSON config at startup (DC_MXL_SENDERS_CONFIG
    env var), so they survive a service restart with the same id/state
    instead of only existing after POST /api/senders/ with a random
    uuid4(). Written/kept in sync by dcstranscode/scripts/make-mxl-config.py's
    new --nmos-senders-config flag (ic-server monorepo, not this repo).
  * systemd unit now sets DC_MXL_SENDERS_CONFIG (default
    /etc/nmos-connection/senders.json) so the above actually gets picked
    up by the real deployed service, not just a manually-launched one.

