nmos-dcm (2.2.9+mxl1-4) unstable; urgency=low

  * Fix activator.py's _getCurrentTime(): Timestamp.from_utc() no longer
    exists in modern mediatimestamp - use the plain Timestamp(secs, nanos)
    constructor instead, matching _scheduleAbsolute()'s own convention in
    the same file. Pre-existing bug affecting activation for every
    transport type, not just mxl (nmoscommon's own strict
    mediatimestamp<2.0.0 pin is what the code was actually written
    against; we're running mediatimestamp 5.2.0).

