  * Point the systemd unit's ExecStart at a dedicated venv
    (/opt/dreamcatcher/venv/nmos-connection-management, set up by
    install.sh with --system-site-packages) instead of the system Python
    - nmoscommon needs werkzeug<1.0.0 (BaseResponse, removed in modern
